Part of the Haven monorepo. It uses:

- `@haven/ui` — the Shadcn primitives and the shared theme
- `@haven/backend` — the shared Convex deployment
- `@haven/localization` — the typed `t()` helper
- `@haven/config` — the TypeScript, Biome and PostCSS configuration

## Commands

```bash
pnpm dev --filter {{ dashCase name }}     # start the dev server on port {{ port }}
pnpm build --filter {{ dashCase name }}   # production build
```

## Before the first start

1. Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local`.
2. Put the `CONVEX_URL` value of `packages/backend/.env.local` in it.
3. Add your tables to `packages/backend/convex/schema.ts` with the prefix
   `{{ snakeCase name }}_`.
